<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <title>Telecom Records Request - {{caseId}}</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>OFFICIAL TELECOMMUNICATION RECORDS REQUEST</h1>

    <hr>

    <p>
        <strong>Case Reference:</strong> {{caseId}}
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Date of Request:</strong> {{requestDate}}
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Case Severity:</strong> {{severity}}
    </p>

    <h2>Subject Phone Number</h2>

    <p>
        {{phoneNumber}}
    </p>

    <h2>Case Background</h2>

    <p>
        {{complaint}}
    </p>

    <h2>Records Requested</h2>

    <p>
        The investigating authority requests all available
        call detail records associated with the above phone number.
    </p>

    <p>
        Requested records include:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Incoming call records</li>
        <li>Outgoing call records</li>
        <li>Call timestamps and duration</li>
        <li>Subscriber information</li>
        <li>Available cell tower information</li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <p>
        This request was generated through the Crime OS AI
        case management system.
    </p>

</body>
</html>